    "heading": "As a Multiclass Character",
    "lineStart": 3375,
    "lineEnd": 3378
  },
  "section": "3.165",
  "rulesText": "- Gain the following traits from the Core Paladin Traits table: Hit Point Die, proficiency with Martial weapons, and training with Light and Medium armor and Shields.  \n- Gain the Paladin's level 1 features, which are listed in the Paladin Features table. See the multiclassing rules in “Character Creation” to determine your available spell slots."
}
